  "details": "Add an option to hide your avatar from other users.\n\nHide you avatar from users you have blocked. Hide your avatar from other users based on your safety settings. For example, set so that visitors get sent to see you backup avatar instead of your normal avatar. This can help with preventing ripped avatars seeing as eac does not always pick up on mods straight away, and some users like to make new accounts after getting eac banned. Also because it can help with blocking communication with users who have blocked you.",
